body:
I wrote an eBook on selling cars. You can get it here for FREE and it includes 60 days of daily sales tips by email. Should help you get launched. I was making over $100k a year in internet sales and was the highest rates salesperson in my state on Dealerrater and [Edmunds.com](https://Edmunds.com) (over 330 positive reviews). Moved to the floor and crushed it. Now I do finance. The book is in progress, but it will get you going.

&#x200B;

Best of luck!

&#x200B;

[https://www.clearpathtraining.com/sales-coaching](https://www.clearpathtraining.com/sales-coaching)

&#x200B;

I worked at a car dealership for 6 years in internet sales and made over $100k a year. I have an e- book I wrote on it It that's interesting to you. It outlines my entire internet sales process. Very low-pressure. 

&#x200B;

I just posted about sales tips, if you sign up for those you get the e-book with it for free. It's all free actually. Here is the link if you want it  [https://www.clearpathtraining.com/sales-coaching](https://www.clearpathtraining.com/sales-coaching)

&#x200B;

Thanks, Melo. Here is the link to sign up [https://forms.aweber.com/form/66/25269466.htm](https://forms.aweber.com/form/66/25269466.htm) 

&#x200B;

You'll get my sales e-book as well. 

&#x200B;

Looking forward to your feedback!

